<title>USA: Hawk Corp sells $100 million in junk debt.</title>
<headline>Hawk Corp sells $100 million in junk debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Hawk Corp was priced on Friday, according to market sources. Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co Inc was the lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER: HAWK CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.25 PCT  MATURITY 12/1/03</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES  ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 6/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.25 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD NA	   CALLABLE NON-CALL FOR</p>
<p>FOUR YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
</text>
